OL,4,G2100FOpera Villains with Bryn Terfel
OL,5,     GWelsh bass-baritone Sir Bryn
OL,6,     GTerfel showcases opera's great
OL,7,     Gvillains, from witches and serial
OL,8,     Gkillers to the devil himself,
OL,9,     Gwith music from Sweeney Todd and
OL,10,     GGounod's Faust.
OL,11,G2200FCalm Classics with Myleene Klass
